#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "</AccordionItem>\n"
#| "</Accordion>\n"
#| "While the [timeline drawer](/guides/visualize-circuit-timing) built in to Qiskit is useful for static circuits, it might not accurately reflect the timing of [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) because of implicit operations such as broadcasting and branch determination. As part of dynamic circuit support, Qiskit Runtime returns the accurate circuit timing information inside the job results when requested.\n"
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"While the [timeline drawer](/guides/visualize-circuit-timing) built in to Qiskit is useful for static circuits, it might not accurately reflect the timing of [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) because of implicit operations such as broadcasting and branch determination. As part of dynamic circuit support, IBM Quantum Compute Service returns the accurate circuit timing information inside the job results when requested.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Meskipun [timeline drawer](/guides/visualize-circuit-timing) yang sudah ada di Qiskit berguna untuk circuit statis, ini mungkin tidak mencerminkan timing [dynamic circuit](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) secara akurat karena operasi implisit seperti broadcasting dan penentuan cabang. Sebagai bagian dari dukungan dynamic circuit, Qiskit Runtime mengembalikan informasi timing circuit yang akurat di dalam hasil job saat diminta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- This is an experimental function. It is in preview release status and is therefore subject to change.\n"
"- This function only applies to IBM Quantum Sampler jobs.\n"
"- Although the total circuit time is returned in the \"compilation\" metadata, this is NOT the time used for billing (QPU time).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Catatan\">\n"
"- Ini adalah fungsi eksperimental. Statusnya preview release dan karenanya bisa berubah.\n"
"- Fungsi ini hanya berlaku untuk job IBM Quantum Sampler.\n"
"- Meskipun total waktu circuit dikembalikan dalam metadata \"compilation\", ini BUKAN waktu yang digunakan untuk penagihan (waktu QPU).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable timing data retrieval {#enable-timing-data-retrieval}"
msgstr "Aktifkan pengambilan data timing {#enable-timing-data-retrieval}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To enable timing data retrieval, set the experimental `scheduler_timing` flag to `True` when running the primitive job.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengaktifkan pengambilan data timing, atur flag eksperimental `scheduler_timing` ke `True` saat menjalankan job primitif.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access the circuit timing data {#access-the-circuit-timing-data}"
msgstr "Akses data timing circuit {#access-the-circuit-timing-data}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When requested, the circuit timing data for each PUB is returned in the job result metadata, under `[\"compilation\"][\"scheduler_timing\"][\"timing\"]`. This field contains the raw timing information. To display the timing information, use the built-in visualization tool, as described in the [Visualize the timings](#visualize-timings) section.\n"
msgstr "Saat diminta, data timing circuit untuk setiap PUB dikembalikan dalam metadata hasil job, di bawah `[\"compilation\"][\"scheduler_timing\"][\"timing\"]`. Field ini berisi informasi timing mentah. Untuk menampilkan informasi timing, gunakan alat visualisasi bawaan, seperti yang dijelaskan di bagian [Visualisasikan timing-nya](#visualize-timings).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the following code to access the circuit timing data for the first PUB:\n"
msgstr "Gunakan kode berikut untuk mengakses data timing circuit untuk PUB pertama:\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the raw timing data {#understand-the-raw-timing-data}"
msgstr "Memahami data timing mentah {#understand-the-raw-timing-data}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "While visualizing the circuit timing data by using the `draw_circuit_schedule_timing` method is the most common use case, it might be useful to understand the structure of the raw timing data returned. This could help you, for example, to extract information programmatically.\n"
msgstr "Meskipun memvisualisasikan data timing circuit dengan metode `draw_circuit_schedule_timing` adalah kasus penggunaan yang paling umum, mungkin berguna untuk memahami struktur data timing mentah yang dikembalikan. Ini bisa membantumu, misalnya, untuk mengekstrak informasi secara terprogram.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The timing data returned in `[\"compilation\"][\"scheduler_timing\"][\"timing\"]` is a list of strings. Each string represents a single instruction on some channel and is comma-separated into the following data types:\n"
msgstr "Data timing yang dikembalikan dalam `[\"compilation\"][\"scheduler_timing\"][\"timing\"]` adalah daftar string. Setiap string merepresentasikan satu instruksi pada suatu channel dan dipisahkan koma menjadi tipe data berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Branch` - Determines whether the instruction is in a control flow (then / else) or a main branch.\n"
msgstr "`Branch` - Menentukan apakah instruksi berada dalam alur kontrol (then / else) atau cabang utama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Instruction` - The gate and the qubit to operate on.\n"
msgstr "`Instruction` - Gate dan qubit yang dioperasikan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Channel` - The channel that is being assigned with the instruction. It can be one of the following:\n"
msgstr "`Channel` - Channel yang ditetapkan dengan instruksi. Bisa salah satu dari berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Qubit x` - The drive channel for qubit _x_.\n"
msgstr "`Qubit x` - Channel drive untuk qubit _x_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`AWGRx_y` (arbitrary waveform generator readout) - Used by readout channels to communicate when measuring qubits. The _x_ and _y_ arguments correspond to the readout instrument ID and the qubit number, respectively.\n"
msgstr "`AWGRx_y` (arbitrary waveform generator readout) - Digunakan oleh channel readout untuk berkomunikasi saat mengukur qubit. Argumen _x_ dan _y_ bersesuaian dengan ID instrumen readout dan nomor qubit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`T0` - The instruction start time within the complete schedule\n"
msgstr "`T0` - Waktu mulai instruksi dalam jadwal lengkap.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Duration` - The instruction's duration, in units of _dt_ seconds,  where 1 dt = 1 scheduling cycle. You can find the `dt` value of a backend by using [`backend.dt`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#dt).\n"
msgstr "`Duration` - Durasi instruksi, dalam satuan _dt_ detik, di mana 1 dt = 1 siklus penjadwalan. Kamu bisa menemukan nilai `dt` sebuah backend menggunakan [`backend.dt`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#dt).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Pulse` - The type of pulse operation being used.\n"
msgstr "`Pulse` - Jenis operasi pulse yang digunakan.\n"

